sition-colors leading-tight\">GTM Partner</span><span class=\"text-[8px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-text-muted/50 leading-none\">Your Go-To-Market Team</span></div></a><a class=\"btn-primary text-xs sm:text-sm !py-2.5 !px-4 sm:!px-5\" href=\"/apply\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Book a Free Call</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Book a Free Case Growth Call</span></a></div></nav><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"pt-32 pb-10 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-14\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-6\">The system</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary leading-[1.1] mb-6\">How the leads you already paid for become signed cases.</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">The long version. Two offers, the AI that runs them, the states we still have open, and what you get to see.</p></div></section><section class=\"py-14 lg:py-20 bg-surface-raised\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"reveal text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">The problem</p><h2 class=\"reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6\">Your intake team is human.</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-6\">Call your own intake line one afternoon and listen. Some days they are sharp. Some days they are tired. Every day there are more leads than hours. A lead that does not answer twice gets a note and drops to the bottom of the pile. A lead that comes in at 9pm waits until morning. A lead from four months ago is not called at all. You already paid for every one of them.</p><p class=\"text-text-primary font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12\">We do not replace your intake team. We give them teammates that never get tired.</p><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-10\"><button class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition-colors bg-brand/15 border border-brand/40 text-brand\">Without GTM Partner</button><button class=\"px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition-colors border border-border-subtle text-text-muted hover:text-text-secondary\">With GTM Partner</button></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-2 bottom-2 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border-subtle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"relative space-y-0\"><li><div class=\"mx-auto h-11 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-surface border-border-default\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap px-3 truncate\">Lead comes in</span></div></li><li><div class=\"h-11 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none;position:relative\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></span><span class=\"text-red-400/80\">Nobody answers fast enough</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 text-[10px] font-semibold text-brand transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(.94);transition-delay:0ms;position:absolute\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg>Answered in under a minute</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto h-11 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-surface border-border-default\" style=\"width:74%\"><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap px-3 truncate\">Someone answers</span></div></li><li><div class=\"h-11 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none;position:relative\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></span><span class=\"text-red-400/80\">Form dropped or call missed</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 text-[10px] font-semibold text-brand transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(.94);transition-delay:0ms;position:absolute\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg>Called straight back</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto h-11 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-surface border-border-default\" style=\"width:55%\"><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap px-3 truncate\">The inquiry is complete</span></div></li><li><div class=\"h-11 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none;position:relative\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></span><span class=\"text-red-400/80\">Goes quiet after the first call</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 text-[10px] font-semibold text-brand transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(.94);transition-delay:0ms;position:absolute\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg>Followed up for five days</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto h-11 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-surface border-border-default\" style=\"width:39%\"><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap px-3 truncate\">They stay in the conversation</span></div></li><li><div class=\"h-11 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none;position:relative\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400/80\"></span><span class=\"text-red-400/80\">Marked dead, sits in the CRM</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 text-[10px] font-semibold text-brand transition-all duration-500\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(.94);transition-delay:0ms;position:absolute\"><svg class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5\"></path></svg>Recover</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto h-11 rounded-lg border flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-surface border-border-default\" style=\"width:26%\"><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-text-secondary whitespace-nowrap px-3 truncate\">They book a consult</span></div></li><li class=\"pt-4\"><div class=\"mx-auto h-12 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-[width] duration-700 ease-out bg-gradient-to-r from-brand to-brand-light shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(200,162,78,0.18)]\" style=\"width:26%\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-surface whitespace-nowrap px-3\">Signed case</span></div></li></ol></div><p class=\"mt-10 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Every leak is a case you already paid for. We seal them in order, starting with the cheapest one to fix.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"offers\" class=\"py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">What we do</p><h2 class=\"reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-12\">Two offers. Pick either one.</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"card !border-brand/25 flex flex-col\"><span class=\"self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand/10 border border-brand/25 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-5\">Start here</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2\">Recover</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-brand font-medium mb-4\">Turn your dead database into signed cases.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6\">We work every old lead in your CRM with AI text and calls, in your firm’s name. The ones still worth having get booked straight into your intake team’s calendar.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">You pay when a case signs, and not before</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">No setup fee, no software fee, no retainer</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">No new ad budget</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">Works on any database, any size</span></li></ul><a href=\"#recover\" class=\"btn-primary w-full justify-center\">How Recover works</a></div><div class=\"card flex flex-col\"><span class=\"self-start px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-overlay border border-border-default text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-secondary mb-5\">Recover included</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2\">Scale</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-brand font-medium mb-4\">Exclusive new leads in your state, yours alone.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6\">We run the ads, own the funnel, and qualify every lead before it reaches you. We hold one firm per state, and that exclusivity is written into the agreement.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">Never resold or re-routed, in writing</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">One firm per state, and we hold the line</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">We fund the ad spend</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand mt-0.5 shrink-0\">✓</span><span class=\"text-sm text-text-secondary\">Recover included at no extra cost</span></li></ul><a href=\"#scale\" class=\"btn-secondary w-full justify-center\">Check your state</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"recover\" class=\"py-14 lg:py-20 bg-surface-raised\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">Offer one: Recover</p><h2 class=\"reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-5\">This is what your old leads get</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-5\">A short text that reads like a person, not a campaign. It answers questions, checks a couple of details against your rules, and books the consult. Anyone who wants out is removed for good.</p><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6\">We check accident dates against your state’s statute of limitations first, so we only chase cases you can still sign. On a four month old database that matters more than it does on a fresh lead.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Names and firm are made up. The flow is the real one.</p></div><div class=\"card !p-0 overflow-hidden max-w-xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-border-subtle bg-surface\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-text-secondary\">Example conversation</span></div><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted\">AI · SMS</span></div><div class=\"px-5 py-5 space-y-3 min-h-[140px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><span class=\"bg-surface-overlay rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md px-4 py-3 flex gap-1.5\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-text-muted\" style=\"animation:float 1s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:0s\"></span><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-text-muted\" style=\"animation:float 1s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:0.15s\"></span><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-text-muted\" style=\"animation:float 1s ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:0.3s\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"px-5 py-4 border-t border-border-subtle bg-surface min-h-[84px] flex flex-col justify-center\"><span class=\"text-xs text-text-muted\">Sarah is typing…</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"scale\" class=\"py-14 lg:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">Offer two: Scale</p><h2 class=\"reveal text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-5\">Is your state still open?</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-10\">Every lead we send is exclusive to your firm. We do not resell it and we do not re-route it, and that is in the agreement, in writing. Greyed out states already have a partner firm, so we are not taking another one there.</p><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 mb-6\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-[3px] bg-brand\"></span><span class=\"text-xs te